    {
      "id": "u_c2f99978f1a1b9b5a25141c1_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "For bulleted and numbered lists, it's possible to configure an alternative marker such as squares or Roman numbering by pressing the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ icon. For numbered lists, it's also possible to specify the number to start at or whether to count in reverse order. On the __TRILIUM_PH_1__Mobile Frontend__TRILIUM_PH_2__, these are in the row of the __TRILIUM_PH_3__List ›__TRILIUM_PH_4__ button, which shows while the cursor is in a list; its __TRILIUM_PH_5__List type__TRILIUM_PH_6__ button also turns the list into another kind, to-do lists included.",
      "sourceHash": "c2f99978f1a1b9b5a25141c172d9f21f3320cc10307a45dd5e02c7fa186b82d4",
      "context": "Lists",
      "contextHash": "308d5a0903f2c5714ec7774808fc9a67b92c602a01a69b2084b05bdb2f6ae699",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ba83851073d5d7241c55dc1b_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Keyboard interaction__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
