      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_178086bfdfe21d2a9bc37dae_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To create a new list:",
      "sourceHash": "178086bfdfe21d2a9bc37dae7c02bec91cce4c0820760fb8de7fe69a4cae1adf",
      "context": "Lists > Keyboard interaction",
      "contextHash": "89ccfe44429bcfdfdbcddafcd67620e3a22cc27805048f233beb22a0622b0ab0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7ba7fea50ceaeb6acea6adc2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Bulleted list: Start a line with __TRILIUM_PH_0__ or __TRILIUM_PH_1__ followed by a space;",
      "sourceHash": "7ba7fea50ceaeb6acea6adc22f1cdb8ce6a732f692400c533d9e8d56b7c09e18",
      "context": "Lists > Keyboard interaction",
      "contextHash": "89ccfe44429bcfdfdbcddafcd67620e3a22cc27805048f233beb22a0622b0ab0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cbfe166e2acf23ad2cc5b3da_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Numbered list: Start a line with __TRILIUM_PH_0__ or __TRILIUM_PH_1__ followed by a space;",
      "sourceHash": "cbfe166e2acf23ad2cc5b3da498f8bb808655f847e97111a64d87ce3ffe65ffd",
      "context": "Lists > Keyboard interaction",
      "contextHash": "89ccfe44429bcfdfdbcddafcd67620e3a22cc27805048f233beb22a0622b0ab0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ea0e6cb12ff46bc10443fe3c_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To-do list: Start a line with __TRILIUM_PH_0__ for an unchecked item or __TRILIUM_PH_1__ for a checked item.",
      "sourceHash": "ea0e6cb12ff46bc10443fe3c41e1c88f97d5f533223f85903395d7c662cb6fe0",
      "context": "Lists > Keyboard interaction",
      "contextHash": "89ccfe44429bcfdfdbcddafcd67620e3a22cc27805048f233beb22a0622b0ab0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_430cfeed49ad0c52991e49e8_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To create a new item in the list, press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "430cfeed49ad0c52991e49e8b6e9c3ea300ce088f3dc81001ff0c7b8f7831baf",
      "context": "Lists > Keyboard interaction",
      "contextHash": "89ccfe44429bcfdfdbcddafcd67620e3a22cc27805048f233beb22a0622b0ab0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f08cea4a4b1bd0e31a93bad9_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To create a blank line within a list item, press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Shift__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "f08cea4a4b1bd0e31a93bad9884c6b790285c23227dc1145b471bd1ef190d2de",
      "context": "Lists > Keyboard interaction",
      "contextHash": "89ccfe44429bcfdfdbcddafcd67620e3a22cc27805048f233beb22a0622b0ab0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_39540b3fc4f5deb2663047ba_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To exit out of the list, press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_1__ twice.",
      "sourceHash": "39540b3fc4f5deb2663047ba4007ee0e70f1ce11b26936d8fc9b16c2c46c13f0",
      "context": "Lists > Keyboard interaction",
      "contextHash": "89ccfe44429bcfdfdbcddafcd67620e3a22cc27805048f233beb22a0622b0ab0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a69e2cd5cc42e064a28734e1_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To merge two lists, simply delete the gap between them.",
      "sourceHash": "a69e2cd5cc42e064a28734e1b041cd144fe12192ebcbbe2a941a7eb19ff65c09",
      "context": "Lists > Keyboard interaction",
      "contextHash": "89ccfe44429bcfdfdbcddafcd67620e3a22cc27805048f233beb22a0622b0ab0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4227794c6a7c0ddcaf69bcbe_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To create nested lists, simply use the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button (see __TRILIUM_PH_1__Indentation__TRILIUM_PH_2__ in __TRILIUM_PH_3__Other features__TRILIUM_PH_4__) or the __TRILIUM_PH_5__Tab__TRILIUM_PH_6__ key. To decrease the nesting level for the current element, press __TRILIUM_PH_7__Shift__TRILIUM_PH_8__+__TRILIUM_PH_9__Tab__TRILIUM_PH_10__.",
      "sourceHash": "4227794c6a7c0ddcaf69bcbec33234b171134200a1ba7369ed9ed5b7fa54c130",
      "context": "Lists > Keyboard interaction",
      "contextHash": "89ccfe44429bcfdfdbcddafcd67620e3a22cc27805048f233beb22a0622b0ab0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ece94377deb113be4b8e47e2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The menu of the block handle, described in __TRILIUM_PH_0__Formatting toolbar__TRILIUM_PH_1__, has __TRILIUM_PH_2__Insert item above__TRILIUM_PH_3__, __TRILIUM_PH_4__Insert item below__TRILIUM_PH_5__ and __TRILIUM_PH_6__Insert child item__TRILIUM_PH_7__, which add an empty item above the item, below it and its nested items, or as its first nested item.",
      "sourceHash": "ece94377deb113be4b8e47e2390b213e5f0fcb2d9158bb625614b33b5ab5d6f6",
      "context": "Lists > Keyboard interaction",
      "contextHash": "89ccfe44429bcfdfdbcddafcd67620e3a22cc27805048f233beb22a0622b0ab0",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
