    {
      "id": "u_d2f42081ed067c11ca6b9b52_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Starting with Trilium v0.104.0, it is possible to collapse nested list items. This applies to bullet lists, numbered lists as well as to-do lists.",
      "sourceHash": "d2f42081ed067c11ca6b9b52a995dec6714b60058accfb3eb59e279b8ba71424",
      "context": "Lists > Collapsible lists",
      "contextHash": "2268f22819b8a4dcda7df533a1093f2b3a53a849a382397aee03ddaa90f42682",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_81eed35a56c2d65f826f51fe_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To collapse or expand a list item that has nested sub-items:",
      "sourceHash": "81eed35a56c2d65f826f51fecf8363dc1946b204776806843eab2f3ad43dd394",
      "context": "Lists > Collapsible lists",
      "contextHash": "2268f22819b8a4dcda7df533a1093f2b3a53a849a382397aee03ddaa90f42682",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_900d9a4be83b8ab7113018ea_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Using the mouse, move the cursor over the list item and an arrow will appear to its left. Clicking it will toggle between collapsed and expanded.",
      "sourceHash": "900d9a4be83b8ab7113018ea66fcb2665f8d247e5821faf6afab437b7e4d7f80",
      "context": "Lists > Collapsible lists",
      "contextHash": "2268f22819b8a4dcda7df533a1093f2b3a53a849a382397aee03ddaa90f42682",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_921c400ac9e22c1a84534db1_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For bullet lists and numbered lists, it's also possible to click directly on the marker (e.g. the bullet or the number) instead of on the arrow to collapse or expand it. This won't work for to-do lists since this would toggle the to-do instead.",
      "sourceHash": "921c400ac9e22c1a84534db1fc4b62d864252bbda297f3991cb92c2a88a3be44",
      "context": "Lists > Collapsible lists",
      "contextHash": "2268f22819b8a4dcda7df533a1093f2b3a53a849a382397aee03ddaa90f42682",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e5c93031f82322842c995cce_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__+__TRILIUM_PH_2__Alt__TRILIUM_PH_3__+__TRILIUM_PH_4__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_5__ which will toggle the collapse/expand state for the item at the cursor position.",
      "sourceHash": "e5c93031f82322842c995cce47cd670ad3608e419520a2df7451fa7d06f4f069",
      "context": "Lists > Collapsible lists",
      "contextHash": "2268f22819b8a4dcda7df533a1093f2b3a53a849a382397aee03ddaa90f42682",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b1127c181422d49309503f36_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Of note:",
      "sourceHash": "b1127c181422d49309503f36548a2c29f6b449d0cd3c4f00de23abc80b441818",
      "context": "Lists > Collapsible lists",
      "contextHash": "2268f22819b8a4dcda7df533a1093f2b3a53a849a382397aee03ddaa90f42682",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f86e8718c1be17f0758a8e02_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Collapsed items always show the arrow to indicate its state.",
      "sourceHash": "f86e8718c1be17f0758a8e0284e0e891571739d7c7bef8426c0967bf9d7091e5",
      "context": "Lists > Collapsible lists",
      "contextHash": "2268f22819b8a4dcda7df533a1093f2b3a53a849a382397aee03ddaa90f42682",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ac736abc026f94552653b24b_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The collapsed state is saved at note level and synced across instances, which means that it will restore after a refresh or reopening of the application.",
      "sourceHash": "ac736abc026f94552653b24b430bfe4b2b7a03ae5c6c1e220004527660170956",
      "context": "Lists > Collapsible lists",
      "contextHash": "2268f22819b8a4dcda7df533a1093f2b3a53a849a382397aee03ddaa90f42682",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4b0a0d6f8d9ba45e9c4fa877_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The collapsed state is also persisted in __TRILIUM_PH_0__Import & Export__TRILIUM_PH_1__, but only for the HTML format. Markdown exports will not preserve the collapse state.",
      "sourceHash": "4b0a0d6f8d9ba45e9c4fa8771f56ecffa9baed9a4475dc8101b2dc0f8ae90bf9",
      "context": "Lists > Collapsible lists",
      "contextHash": "2268f22819b8a4dcda7df533a1093f2b3a53a849a382397aee03ddaa90f42682",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_60a737ccc481b1aa5103ee19_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Collapsible bullets only exist in the context of editable text notes. Read-only lists will always be fully expanded.",
      "sourceHash": "60a737ccc481b1aa5103ee1998fb5e7c612abdddde94b34c90d8c407b16c9b35",
      "context": "Lists > Collapsible lists",
      "contextHash": "2268f22819b8a4dcda7df533a1093f2b3a53a849a382397aee03ddaa90f42682",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b60674cfbce5d6404958115b_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The list items will auto-expand on edit to avoid typing in a hidden area.",
      "sourceHash": "b60674cfbce5d6404958115bc187a7a5e74dd81f912b3a5f3cd9151f65a8b0a4",
      "context": "Lists > Collapsible lists",
      "contextHash": "2268f22819b8a4dcda7df533a1093f2b3a53a849a382397aee03ddaa90f42682",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
